"""
The QR code of Wolly.Qr for a decoder: prints the data URI of
the code of its one argument, the same as GET /qr of examples/hello.

    qruri TEXT

It prints the URI on one line and exits 0, or prints why not and exits 1:
no argument, or a text that does not fit a code.  A test reads the PNG
in it with zbarimg.
"""
module Wolly.Example.QrUri is
    """
    The command of the arguments.
    No contract: the outcome is the result of I/O.
    """
    function main(root: RootCapability): ExitCode;
end module.
